title: detect → normalize → dedupe
---
flowchart TD
    DET[detector] -->|candidate<br/>source/repo/title/body/<br/>symptomHash/detectedAt| NORM[正規化]
    NORM --> HASH[issue key =<br/>source+repo+symptomHash]
